Bicycle?

92
00:06:08,580 --> 00:06:09,580
No, walking.

93
00:06:09,580 --> 00:06:10,580
Ok, walking.

94
00:06:10,580 --> 00:06:11,580
Yeah.

95
00:06:11,580 --> 00:06:12,580
Inshallah.

96
