How much?

97
00:06:13,580 --> 00:06:14,580
18 rupees.

98
00:06:14,580 --> 00:06:15,580
Ok.

99
00:06:24,580 --> 00:06:36,580
Em desvio temporalment de la carretera principal, de la Karakarum Highway, per agafar aquest pont

100
00:06:36,580 --> 00:06:43,580
que em portarà a l'altra banda de la vall i després aquesta carretera em portarà fins a Gilgit

101
00:06:43,580 --> 00:06:45,580
